From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bonsai-27b-fusion <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs(fusion): this branch is 437 commits behind upstream
 master, and that is not ours to fix

Measured 2026-09-19: upstream master is 1af554f8f; this tree sits on PrismML's prism
fork (9a9394a) whose merge-base is 5ea87ddad (2026-08-25, b10615-1), so it is 437
commits behind master - 36 in ggml-cuda, 17 in ggml-cpu, 76 in src/, 36 in common/ -
and 430 behind the b11046 branch's own base.

No upstream rebase here: prism is PrismML's branch and its 93 own commits are the
point of it. The lever we control is the forward port of the private types onto newer
upstream (see consolidationIfWanted), or simply tracking PrismML releases.
---
 fusion/state.json | 21 +++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+)

diff --git a/fusion/state.json b/fusion/state.json
index 585a7b0..25ad8ff 100644
--- a/fusion/state.json
+++ b/fusion/state.json
@@ -373,5 +373,26 @@
     "movedWith": "temp_clean_later/scripts/restructure-bonsai-layout.py (same-volume renames only, sizes verified, idempotent)",
     "open": "no mmproj-*.gguf is present, so the vision tower is unavailable. The upstream repo ships it; LM Studio would auto-pair an mmproj file placed in the same repo folder.",
     "date": "2026-09-19"
+  },
+  "upstreamCurrency": {
+    "measuredAt": "2026-09-19 20:5x +08:00",
+    "officialMaster": {
+      "commit": "1af554f8fc78ba029665a47b839484d9763e2a75",
+      "date": "2026-09-19 15:37 +0300",
+      "subject": "server : improve startup log messages (#29125)",
+      "how": "git ls-remote origin refs/heads/master, then fetched into a temp ref and counted with rev-list"
+    },
+    "verdict": "NOT at upstream master",
+    "pinnedTo": "PrismML prism branch 9a9394a; merge-base with upstream master is 5ea87ddad (2026-08-25, b10615-1)",
+    "commitsBehindMaster": 437,
+    "breakdown": {
+      "ggml-cuda": 36,
+      "ggml-cpu": 17,
+      "src/": 76,
+      "common/": 36
+    },
+    "alsoBehindOwnSibling": "430 commits behind the b11046 fusion base, on top of which that tree is 7 behind master",
+    "upgradeCost": "not ours to change unilaterally - this is PrismML fork/prism; upgrading the base means rebasing their 93 own commits. The lever we control is the forward port of their private types onto a newer upstream (see consolidationIfWanted), or tracking their releases.",
+    "recommendation": "do not attempt an upstream rebase here. Track PrismML releases and, if the ternary model needs newer upstream, port the private types forward instead."
   }
 }
